WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:12.640
Rex and Sara gulped.

2
00:00:12.641 --> 00:00:22.155
"The dinosaur is really big!" Rex whispered.

3
00:00:22.156 --> 00:00:25.157
The big dinosaur blinked.

4
00:00:25.158 --> 00:00:28.465
"Hello," he said.

5
00:00:28.466 --> 00:00:31.779
"He looks friendly," Sara whispered.

6
00:00:31.780 --> 00:00:34.883
Rex nodded.

7
00:00:34.884 --> 00:00:38.823
"Um, hi," Rex said.

8
00:00:38.824 --> 00:00:41.520
"I'm Rex."

9
00:00:41.521 --> 00:00:46.559
Sara smiled. "I'm Sara."

10
00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:51.645
"Nice to meet you," the dinosaur said.

11
00:00:51.646 --> 00:00:56.591
"I'm Ricky."

12
00:00:56.592 --> 00:00:59.976
Suddenly a big wave crashed.

13
00:00:59.977 --> 00:01:09.306
Rex and Sara fell down and laughed.

14
00:01:09.307 --> 00:01:18.262
Ricky's eyes lit up. "Watch this!"

15
00:01:18.263 --> 00:01:21.891
He swam off.

16
00:01:21.892 --> 00:01:25.986
Another wave formed.

17
00:01:25.987 --> 00:01:31.882
Ricky floated on the wave. "Whee!"

18
00:01:31.883 --> 00:01:35.235
Sara clapped.

19
00:01:35.236 --> 00:01:38.731
"Cool!" Rex said.

20
00:01:38.732 --> 00:01:46.605
Ricky grinned. "Hop on my back!"

21
00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:52.009
Rex and Sara climbed up.

22
00:01:52.010 --> 00:01:59.805
They waited for the next wave.

23
00:01:59.806 --> 00:02:05.518
"Here we go!" Ricky said.

24
00:02:05.519 --> 00:02:12.764
"Woo-hoo!" Rex and Sara cheered.

25
00:02:12.765 --> 00:02:16.237
The wave went fast.

26
00:02:16.238 --> 00:02:21.996
Ricky fell onto the sand. Boomph!

27
00:02:21.997 --> 00:02:24.855
Ricky wiggled.

28
00:02:24.856 --> 00:02:31.121
His fins flapped in the air.

29
00:02:31.122 --> 00:02:39.992
Ricky gulped. "I'm stuck!"

